  OFFSET at equilibrium (vertical a 3A" <- X 1A'):
    CASCI      3.4796 eV
    SC-NEVPT2  3.4946 eV   (07, own singlet CASSCF: 3.5502)
    FIC-NEVPT2 3.4827 eV
    references 03 3.4477, 04 3.4142, mean 3.4310 eV
    SC +0.064 eV and FIC +0.052 eV from the reference mean; FIC - SC = -0.012 eV
